* SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
* framebuf.resource (Exec900; no NDK counterpart), in the C900 dialect
* of exec_lib.fd.  Each function takes FrameBufBase as its first argument.
* AllocFB follows misc.resource's AllocMiscResource: NULL on success,
* else the owner's name.
##base _FrameBufBase
##bias 6
##public
GetFBInfo()() struct FBInfo *
AllocFB(name)(char *) char *
FreeFB()() void
##end
